# Gargantuan Leech: only Caves you control and Cave cards in YOUR graveyard count. Bot2 has a Promising Vein on the battlefield (played on turn 4) and one in its own graveyard (sacrificed to its own
# search on turn 4), and Bot1 has none, so the Leech still costs the full {7}{B}: seven mana is short, the eighth pays exactly (CR 601.2f).
